    \list 1
    \li Download and install Qt. To do this, follow the instructions on the
        \l{Get and Install Qt} page.
    \li Install all the necessary tools and configure the development
        environment. For details, see \l {Qt for Android Prerequisites}.
    \li To develop a simple application from scratch, see
        \l {\QC: Tutorial: Mobile application}.
\endlist

